sequenceDiagram
    participant Extension as Extension Host
    participant ViewHtml as getViewHtml()
    participant Webview as React Webview
    participant Store as Zustand Store
    participant Component as React Component

    Note over Extension,Component: Initial Load Flow
    Extension->>ViewHtml: render(viewName, data)
    ViewHtml->>ViewHtml: getReactWebviewHtml()
    ViewHtml-->>Extension: HTML with data-view attribute
    Extension->>Webview: createWebviewPanel(HTML)
    Webview->>Webview: React.render(<App />)
    Webview->>Extension: { type: 'ready' }
    Note over Extension,Webview: Ready-signal handshake complete

    Note over Extension,Component: Data Initialization
    Extension->>Webview: { type: 'dashboardInit', payload: {...} }
    Webview->>Store: setCourses(payload.courses)
    Store-->>Component: courses state updated
    Component->>Component: re-render with data

    Note over Extension,Component: User Action Flow
    Component->>Component: onClick handler
    Component->>Webview: vscodeApi.postMessage()
    Webview->>Extension: { type: 'command', command: 'openExercise', payload: {...} }
    Extension->>Extension: handle command
    Extension->>ViewHtml: render('exerciseDetail', data)
    ViewHtml-->>Extension: new HTML
    Extension->>Webview: panel.webview.html = newHtml
    Webview->>Webview: React.unmount + mount
    Webview->>Extension: { type: 'ready' }
    Extension->>Webview: { type: 'exerciseDetailInit', payload: {...} }

    Note over Extension,Component: Reload Flow (no navigation)
    Component->>Webview: vscodeApi.postMessage()
    Webview->>Extension: { type: 'command', command: 'reloadDashboard' }
    Extension->>Extension: fetch fresh data
    Extension->>Webview: { type: 'dashboardInit', payload: {...} }
    Webview->>Store: setCourses(newData)
    Store-->>Component: courses state updated
    Note over Extension,Component: No re-render, just state update

    Note over Extension,Component: WebSocket Update Flow
    Extension->>Extension: WebSocket message received
    Extension->>Webview: { type: 'websocketUpdate', payload: {...} }
    Webview->>Store: handle update
    Store-->>Component: state updated
    Component->>Component: re-render

    Note over Extension,Component: Error Flow
    Component->>Component: throw error
    Component->>Webview: ErrorBoundary.componentDidCatch
    Webview->>Extension: { type: 'error', payload: { message, stack, componentStack } }
    Extension->>Extension: log error + telemetry
